- License: GNU General Public License v2.0
- Website: https://git-scm.com/

Both the in-app terminal and the Git panel run `git` as a separate program. The
executables are shipped as `libgit*.so`, `libscalar*.so`, `libcurl*.so`,
`libwcurl*.so` and `libgit-askpass*.so` under
`core-git/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/` and are symlinked to their canonical names
(`git`, `git-upload-pack`, `git-receive-pack`, `scalar`, `curl`, ...) in the
app's private files directory at runtime. Squircle CE only exchanges data with
them over process stdin/stdout; it neither links against them nor contains
derivative work of them. This is mere aggregation, so the application itself
remains under Apache License 2.0 while the bundled `git` executables stay under
GPL-2.0.

The binaries are unmodified builds taken from the
[Termux](https://termux.dev/) apt repository. Per GPL-2.0, the corresponding
source code is published at https://github.com/git/git and can also be
requested from the maintainers of this project.

